#: src/model/w42-template.c:260
msgid "Date:"
msgstr "Fecha:"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:272
msgid "Subject:"
msgstr "Asunto:"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:272
msgid "What this is about"
msgstr "De qué se trata"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:275
msgid "The memorandum goes here."
msgstr "Escriba aquí el texto del memorándum."

#: src/model/w42-template.c:279
msgid "FACSIMILE"
msgstr "FAX"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:281
msgid "Their Name"
msgstr "Nombre del destinatario"

#. Translators: on a fax cover sheet, the fax number.
#: src/model/w42-template.c:283 src/model/w42-template.c:285
msgid "Fax:"
msgstr "Fax:"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:283
msgid "Their Number"
msgstr "Número del destinatario"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:285
msgid "Your Number"
msgstr "Su número"

#. Translators: on a fax cover sheet, how many pages are sent.
#: src/model/w42-template.c:287
msgid "Pages:"
msgstr "Páginas:"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:287
msgid "1, including this one"
msgstr "1, incluida esta"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:290
msgid "The message goes here."
msgstr "Escriba aquí el mensaje."

#: src/model/w42-template.c:294
msgid "The Title of the Report"
msgstr "Título del informe"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:299
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Resumen"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:300
msgid "What the report says, in a paragraph."
msgstr "Lo que dice el informe, en un párrafo."

#: src/model/w42-template.c:301
msgid "The Matter in Hand"
msgstr "El asunto que nos ocupa"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:302
msgid "The body of the report goes here."
msgstr "Escriba aquí el cuerpo del informe."

#: src/model/w42-template.c:303
msgid "A Point Worth Its Own Heading"
msgstr "Un punto que merece su propio título"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:304
msgid "And what there is to say about it."
msgstr "Y lo que hay que decir al respecto."

#: src/model/w42-template.c:305
msgid "What Follows From It"
msgstr "Lo que se desprende de ello"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:306
msgid "The conclusion goes here."
msgstr "Escriba aquí la conclusión."

#. Translators: in the notes of a meeting, who attended.
#: src/model/w42-template.c:315
msgid "Present:"
msgstr "Asistentes:"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:315
msgid "Who was there"
msgstr "Quiénes asistieron"

#. Translators: in the notes of a meeting, who sent word that they
#. * could not attend.
#: src/model/w42-template.c:318
msgid "Apologies:"
msgstr "Ausentes con excusa:"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:318
msgid "Who was not"
msgstr "Quiénes no asistieron"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:321
msgid "Matters discussed"
msgstr "Asuntos tratados"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:322
msgid "The first matter."
msgstr "El primer asunto."

#: src/model/w42-template.c:323
msgid "Decisions"
msgstr "Acuerdos"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:324
msgid "What was decided, and by whom it will be done."
msgstr "Lo que se acordó y quién se encargará de hacerlo."

#: src/model/w42-template.c:342
msgid "The Title of the Novel"
msgstr "Título de la novela"

#. Translators: under the title of a novel, what the book is.
#: src/model/w42-template.c:344
msgid "A Novel"
msgstr "Novela"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:345 src/model/w42-template.c:408
msgid "Chapter One"
msgstr "Capítulo uno"

#. Translators: Heading 1 is a style's name, which is not
#. * translated.
#: src/model/w42-template.c:348
msgid ""
"The first lines of the book go here. The paragraphs are justified and set "
"in, as a printed novel's are, and each chapter starts on a new page: give "
"its title the Heading 1 style."
msgstr ""
"Aquí van las primeras líneas del libro. Los párrafos están justificados y "
"con sangría, como en una novela impresa, y cada capítulo empieza en una "
"página nueva: aplique a su título el estilo Heading 1."

#. Translators: Tools, Language, Set Language, Default and Word Count
#. * Goal are the menus, menu items and button of those names: use the
#. * words the translated menus and dialog use.
#: src/model/w42-template.c:355
msgid ""
"Tools ▸ Language ▸ Set Language, Default makes the book's language the one "
"its spelling, quotation marks and hyphenation follow; Tools ▸ Word Count "
"Goal sets how long it is to be."
msgstr ""
"Herramientas ▸ Idioma ▸ Definir idioma, Predeterminar establece el idioma "
"del libro, el que siguen su ortografía, sus comillas y su separación "
"silábica; Herramientas ▸ Objetivo de palabras fija su extensión."

#: src/model/w42-template.c:361
msgid "A new scene begins after a break like the one above."
msgstr "Una nueva escena empieza tras una separación como la de arriba."

#: src/model/w42-template.c:362
msgid "Chapter Two"
msgstr "Capítulo dos"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:363
msgid "And the story goes on."
msgstr "Y la historia continúa."

#. Translators: the running head of a manuscript, the page number
#. * after it; the writer puts their own surname and title in place
#. * of these, as "The story begins here. Replace Surname and TITLE"
#. * tells them, so use the same two words there.
#: src/model/w42-template.c:384
msgid "Surname / TITLE"
msgstr "Apellido / TÍTULO"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:401
msgid "Your Email and Telephone"
msgstr "Su correo electrónico y teléfono"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:404
msgid "THE TITLE"
msgstr "EL TÍTULO"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:405
msgid "by Your Name"
msgstr "por Su nombre"

#. Translators: on a manuscript's title page, how long the book is.
#: src/model/w42-template.c:407
msgid "About 80,000 words"
msgstr "Unas 80 000 palabras"

#. Translators: Surname and TITLE are the words of "Surname / TITLE";
#. * View and Header and Footer are the menu items of that name.
#: src/model/w42-template.c:411
msgid ""
"The story begins here. Replace Surname and TITLE in View ▸ Header and Footer "
"with your own; the page number follows them on every page but the first."
msgstr ""
"La historia empieza aquí. Sustituya Apellido y TÍTULO en Ver ▸ Encabezado y "
"pie de página por los suyos; el número de página los sigue en todas las "
"páginas salvo la primera."

#. Translators: the "#" on the line above is the break meant.
#: src/model/w42-template.c:417
msgid "A scene break is a hash mark on a line of its own."
msgstr "Una separación de escena es una almohadilla sola en una línea."

#. Translators: "default:RTL" for a language written from right to
#. * left, such as Arabic or Urdu; "default:LTR" otherwise.
#: src/ui/w42-application.c:265
